s://flyflix.net/watch/1212763","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-12T21:46:38.759Z"},{"id":"movie-1318413","slug":"movie-1318413","title":"Tiempo de victoria","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/byKFPj2xvKkqMKQ4i0Ayq6N7Z9E.jpg","synopsis":"Quedan 72 horas para el Día D y todo está listo salvo un elemento clave: el tiempo. El capitán James Stagg, jefe del servicio meteorológico británico, recibe el encargo de elaborar el pronóstico más trascendental de la historia. Unas condiciones climáticas adversas podrían arruinar la mayor invasión marítima de la historia, mientras que cualquier retraso podría suponer que los servicios de inteligencia alemanes descubran sus intenciones. El general Dwight D. Eisenhower deberá tomar la decisión que determine el destino de la Segunda Guerra Mundial.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Suspense","Historia","Bélica"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1318413","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-12T21:46:39.033Z"},{"id":"movie-1325734","slug":"movie-1325734","title":"El drama","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zgfBYGYCNcOZ51JDbr6tm45H8y0.jpg","synopsis":"Una pareja, en los días previos a su boda, se enfrenta a una crisis cuando unas inesperadas revelaciones desbaratan lo que uno de ellos creía saber sobre el otro.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Romance","Comedia","Drama"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1325734","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-12T21:46:39.308Z"},{"id":"movie-1545690","slug":"movie-1545690","title":"WWE Money in the Bank 2026","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/wRFDnH3XzwDKV9QU3DTYNU8XX2R.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Acción","Drama"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1545690","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-12