","slug":"movie-1291712","title":"Las catadoras de Hitler","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/t0L4h1PMFBzQLQETruTCH4VcpqK.jpg","synopsis":"Otoño de 1943. La joven Rosa huye de un Berlín bombardeado y se refugia en un pueblo donde viven sus suegros. Rosa descubre rápidamente que en el bosque adyacente se encuentra el cuartel general de Hitler, la llamada 'Guarida del Lobo'. El Führer ve enemigos por todas partes. Su obsesión es que lo envenenen. Una mañana Rose es recogida junto a otras jóvenes del pueblo para probar la comida que le preparan a Hitler.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Drama","Historia"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1291712","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2025,"updatedAt":"2026-10-12T21:48:54.672Z"},{"id":"movie-1368568","slug":"movie-1368568","title":"Um Tio Quase Perfeito 3","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/rA3I7qzs47r4iVRxVLYgP3i7rc5.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Comedia"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1368568","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-12T21:48:54.942Z"},{"id":"movie-1575337","slug":"movie-1575337","title":"La princesa Kaguya del cosmos","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9YrbOSKoreS4oIjuwx9YjkAU8KP.jpg","synopsis":"La vida de Iroha se sale de control cuando Kaguya, una despreocupada fugitiva de la Luna, se muda con ella y la convence para actuar juntas en un mundo virtual.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Animación","Fantasía","Música","Ciencia ficción"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1575337","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-12T21:48:55.224Z"},{"id":"movie-1246215","slug":"movie-1246215","title":"Recreación de un asesinato","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7QNH281dbc4oLedyeuZ6xydk3Nu.jpg","synopsis":"Los doce miembros de un jurado deben decidir si el periodista británico Ian Bailey es culpable del asesinato de la cineasta francesa Sophie Toscan Du Plantier en 1996. Basada en hechos reales, la película reconstruye, a través de las discusiones entre estas doce personas, un caso que invita al espectador a sacar sus propias conclusiones.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Drama","Misterio","Crimen"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1246215","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2025,"updatedAt":"2026-10-12T21:48:55.517Z"},{"id":"movie-1242011","slug":"movie-1242011","title":"Together","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pp2ho64ah9W9jCCIHavXUCuqISr.jpg","synopsis":"Una pareja con problemas en su relación se muda al campo, donde descubren una cueva con una fuerza sobrenatural. Al beber agua de la cueva, comienzan a experimentar transformaciones físicas y emocionales que reflejan su codependencia.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Terror","Romance"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1242011","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2025,"updatedAt":"2026-10-12T21:48:55.801Z"},{"id":"movie-999136","slug":"movie-999136","title":"Do Not Enter","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/1gHygrBcGU2dL9DHcvnj4FJc8pF.jpg","synopsis":"Un grupo de exploradores investiga un viejo hotel abandonado y se encuentran con un extraño ser sobrenatural y un grupo competidor que busca un legendario tesoro escondido.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Terror"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/999136","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-12T21:48:56.071Z"},{"id":"movie-1383091","slug":"movie-1383091","title":"有用的人","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/bFAvhjSTDzy5BjLIK8QXY1TD4ak.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Drama"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1383091","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-