e un traumatismo cerebral que podría poner fin a su carrera. Justo cuando todo parece perdido, Cam recibe un salvavidas cuando su héroe, Isaiah White, un legendario quarterback se ofrece a entrenar a Cam. Pero a medida que el entrenamiento de Cam se acelera, el carisma de Isaiah comienza a cuajar en algo más oscuro, enviando a su protegido a un agujero desorientador que puede costarle más de lo que jamás esperó.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Terror","Misterio","Suspense"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/986097","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2025,"updatedAt":"2026-10-12T21:49:06.835Z"},{"id":"movie-1477170","slug":"movie-1477170","title":"LOL 2.0","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dNjZ6lQCVZMWAxKlqMVAlzGC5FQ.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Comedia"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1477170","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-12T21:49:07.117Z"},{"id":"movie-1590380","slug":"movie-1590380","title":"Ram and Leela","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/j1X0t57PguWBcaa8LAOaAHGyjcK.jpg","synopsis":null,"status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Romance","Comedia"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/1590380","type":"flyflix","contentType":"movie","year":2026,"updatedAt":"2026-10-12T21:49:07.389Z"},{"id":"movie-634649","slug":"movie-634649","title":"Spider-Man: No Way Home","image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/accAPImdjUwgNgocDNWXCGFEcvL.jpg","synopsis":"Peter Parker es desenmascarado y por tanto no es capaz de separar su vida normal de los enormes riesgos que conlleva ser un súper héroe. Cuando pide ayuda a Doctor Strange, los riesgos pasan a ser aún más peligrosos, obligándole a descubrir lo que realmente significa ser Spider-Man.","status":"Released","country":null,"genres":["Acción","Aventura","Ciencia ficción"],"totalEpisodes":null,"sourceUrl":"https://flyflix.net/watch/6